{
  "uid": "obs-evenements",
  "title": "RabbitMQ et événements",
  "description": "Débit par file, arriéré, et surtout les files de rebut — qui doivent rester à zéro. Alimenté par le greffon rabbitmq_prometheus du courtier observé (RABBITMQ_METRICS_TARGET).",
  "tags": [
    "socle"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 48,
      "title": "Si ce dashboard est vide",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Le job `rabbitmq` se découvre par fichier. Fournir `RABBITMQ_METRICS_TARGET` (par exemple `rabbitmq:15692`) à la plateforme, et activer le greffon côté courtier : `rabbitmq-plugins enable rabbitmq_prometheus`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 49,
      "title": "Files de rebut — doivent rester à zéro",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 50,
      "title": "Messages en rebut",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rabbitmq_queue_messages{queue=~\"(?i).*(dlq|dead.?letter|rebut).*\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "description": "Alerte critique dès 1 (§8.4). Un message en rebut est une donnée métier perdue tant que personne ne la rejoue."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 51,
      "title": "Rebut par file",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 18,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rabbitmq_queue_messages{queue=~\"(?i).*(dlq|dead.?letter|rebut).*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 52,
      "title": "Débit et arriéré",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 53,
      "title": "Messages publiés",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (queue) (rate(rabbitmq_queue_messages_published_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 54,
      "title": "Arriéré — messages en attente",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rabbitmq_queue_messages_ready",
          "legendFormat": "{{queue}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Un arriéré qui croît sans redescendre signifie que les consommateurs ne tiennent pas le rythme des producteurs."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "id": 55,
      "title": "Consommateurs par file",
